## Brand & Style

This design system establishes an ultra-responsive, athletic telemetry environment tailored for high-output physical tracking and multi-device telemetry synchronization. The aesthetic pairs the ruthless efficiency of high-performance sports analytics with the refined tactile depth of luminous dark interfaces. It communicates velocity, precision, and relentless personal progress.

The style unites **Tactile Glassmorphism** with **High-Contrast Athletic Minimal**. Deep obsidian and muted slate surfaces recede into the backdrop, allowing high-visibility electric accents to project critical biometric milestones, live cadences, and exertion zones. Optical treatments utilize subtle backdrop blurs, controlled luminescence, and laser-precise strokes to simulate premium instrument dashboards. Motion is purposeful, punchy, and kinetic, ensuring instant readability whether glancing at a phone secured to a spin bike or a watch display during a sprint. Bilingual typography guarantees equivalent visual mass, cadence, and energetic authority across English and Tamil script environments.

## Colors

The palette is engineered for maximum optical legibility against variable outdoor and low-light training conditions:

- **Primary (`#10E563` - Electric Neon Green):** Represents optimal performance, active tracking state, completion, and peak recovery zones. Used for primary CTAs, active telemetry progress arcs, and critical success validations.
- **Secondary (`#00F0FF` - Kinetic Cyan):** Represents biometric connection, pace metrics, smartwatch sync, and structural telemetry layers. Used for secondary graphs, active state indicators, and navigational highlights.
- **Tertiary (`#FF5C00` - High-Output Orange):** Reserved for high heart-rate zones, anaerobic strain thresholds, urgent alerts, and peak performance milestones.
- **Neutral Foundation (`#0B0E14` - Deep Obsidian):** Forms the foundational floor. Paired with layered canvas tones (`#121721` Surface Low, `#1B2232` Surface Base, and `#263045` Surface Raised) to establish depth without sacrificing true black levels on OLED panels.
- **Text & Content Tiers:** On-Surface High (`#F4F7FC`, 95% opacity), On-Surface Mid (`#9AA5BC`, 70% opacity), and On-Surface Low (`#505A70`, 40% opacity).

## Typography

The typographic hierarchy prioritizes instantaneous data extraction during dynamic movement. `Lexend` delivers clear geometric tracking and wide optical counters for quantitative counters, workout stats, and section headers. `Plus Jakarta Sans` delivers warm, readable text for workout descriptions, nutrition logs, and coaching tips.

### Bilingual Handling (English / Tamil)
- For Tamil glyph rendering, retain identical line-height metrics while increasing standard label tracking slightly to account for complex loop forms and diacritics.
- Pair English numeric readings directly with Tamil contextual labels without changing font-size tiers. The visual weight of `Lexend` at 600 weight matches standard Tamil unicode typography at 500-600 weight.
- Never force uppercase transformations on mixed English/Tamil layouts; apply explicit font weights instead to indicate priority.

## Layout & Spacing

The layout model utilizes a fluid 4-column structure on mobile devices (under 600px), transitioning to an 8-column layout on tablets (600px - 1023px), and a 12-column layout on web/desktop telemetry hubs (1024px+).

- **Mobile Viewports:** Designed for one-handed reachability during physical training. The primary touch zones are anchored to the bottom 45% of the viewport. Outer margin is locked at `1rem`, preventing edge clipping while maximizing horizontal space for telemetry cards.
- **Rhythm & Grid:** All horizontal and vertical distributions follow a strict 4px/8px modular cadence. Touch targets maintain a minimum dimension of `48px x 48px` to guarantee zero-miss interactions while in motion.
- **Telemetry Dashboards:** Telemetry dials and multi-metric rings span the full width within margins, maintaining an aspect ratio that prevents vertical viewport pushing.

## Elevation & Depth

Depth is established via **Translucent Glass Strata** rather than heavy drop shadows, preserving an airy, modern athletic display aesthetic:

- **Level 0 (Floor):** True Obsidian (`#0B0E14`), uniform and non-reflective.
- **Level 1 (Sub-surface):** Semi-opaque slate (`#121721` with 80% opacity), featuring `backdrop-filter: blur(16px)` and a subtle `1px` inner stroke (`#FFFFFF` at 6% opacity).
- **Level 2 (Active Cards & Panels):** High-depth frosted obsidian (`#1B2232` at 65% opacity), `backdrop-filter: blur(24px)`, framed with a crisp boundary outline (`#FFFFFF` at 12% opacity).
- **Level 3 (Modal / Floating Overlays):** Highly reactive surface (`#263045` at 85% opacity), accompanied by an ambient, diffused neon back-glow: `0 8px 32px -4px rgba(16, 229, 99, 0.12)`.
- **Telemetry Projection:** Active rings and pulse indicators project a soft, atmospheric light footprint: `box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(16, 229, 99, 0.35)`.

## Shapes

The design system adopts a **Rounded (`2`)** baseline geometry, striking a balance between technical discipline and approachable modern ergonomics:

- **Standard Containers & Cards:** `0.5rem` (8px) on inner nested cards; `1rem` (16px) on primary exterior surface panels.
- **Floating Controls & Action Sheets:** `1.5rem` (24px) for upper corners of bottom sheets and large modular dashboards.
- **Buttons, Badges, & Status Pills:** Fully rounded capsule/pill contours (`9999px`) are reserved exclusively for interactive triggers, filter chips, and real-time state flags to visually distinct them from static structural layout grids.

## Components

### Buttons
- **Primary Action (Active State):** High-voltage background (`#10E563`) with dark obsidian text (`#0B0E14`). Pill-shaped contour, font weight 700. Pressed state transitions to an energetic scale (`0.98`) with a matching neon green perimeter ring.
- **Secondary Action:** Glassmorphism base (`#1B2232` at 60% opacity) with a `1px` border of `#00F0FF` (at 40% opacity) and glowing cyan text.
- **Ghost/Tertiary:** No background, high-contrast white text, active state emits an orange glow under-layer.

### Telemetry Rings & Biometric Dials
- Circular gauges built with an unfulfilled track base (`#263045` at 50% opacity) and an illuminated stroke cap using `#10E563`, `#00F0FF`, or `#FF5C00`.
- Concentric three-ring assemblies feature a 4px gap separation with center-weighted numerical telemetry in `Lexend` heavy weights.

### Glassmorphic Cards
- Multi-metric cards utilize frosted backing, rounded 16px corners, and dual-tone content headers (bilingual title pairing).
- High-intensity metric readouts are pinned to the bottom left, balanced by mini sparkline graphs on the bottom right.

### Chips & Metrics Filters
- Capsule pills with standard `0.5rem` spacing.
- Selected state features a luminous fill (`#00F0FF` with 15% opacity), a solid cyan boundary, and high-visibility text. Unselected state sits at 30% slate opacity with low-contrast borders.

### Inputs & Sliders
- Input fields use sunken obsidian backings (`#07090D`) with a 1px border (`#263045`). On focus, the border dynamically transitions to neon lime with an outer glow.
- Sliders feature a tactile 24px pill handle with high-visibility neon accent tracks and segmented haptic tick marks.

### Checkboxes & Segmented Toggles
- Custom squared-radius toggles (`6px`) with an animated fill stroke. Checkmarks light up with neon green upon completion.
- Multi-state toggles (e.g., metric switching between Imperial/Metric or English/Tamil) use a smooth slide capsule pill mechanism with glass backing.
